{"ep": "12", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:10.26", "end": "0:00:12.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是一个慵懒  而又正常到了极点的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:12.96", "end": "0:00:15.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "盂兰盆会后的盛夏的一天"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:17.73", "end": "0:00:22.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视中正在播放的  是跟我一点关系都没有的同县选手的比赛"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:22.70", "end": "0:00:27.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "出于对弱者的同情心  我不由得支持着正处于落后的一方"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:28.02", "end": "0:00:31.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而这时手机却大声嚷嚷了起来"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:33.39", "end": "0:00:34.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是春日啊…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:35.41", "end": "0:00:36.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你今天很闲吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:36.57", "end": "0:00:36.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啥…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:36.97", "end": "0:00:39.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "两点整全员在车站前集合"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:39.97", "end": "0:00:40.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:42.70", "end": "0:00:44.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "轻描淡写地挂断了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:44.92", "end": "0:00:47.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么就知道我今天很闲的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:47.47", "end": "0:00:48.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "即便如此我可也…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:50.00", "end": "0:00:52.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃…  虽说我什么计划也没有…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 14, "start": "0:00:59.25", "end": "0:01:00.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:00.18", "end": "0:01:04.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "忘跟你说了  带一套泳装骑车过来"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:04.21", "end": "0:01:06.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有  带上足够的钱"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:06.22", "end": "0:01:07.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以上  Over～"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:08.30", "end": "0:01:09.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好烦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:10.57", "end": "0:01:12.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "究竟搞什么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 20, "start": "0:01:13.12", "end": "0:01:15.83", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打手现正悠闲地跑向三垒"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 21, "start": "0:01:16.08", "end": "0:01:18.91", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "投手铃木  在投手丘上一副崩溃的样子"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 22, "start": "0:01:19.34", "end": "0:01:21.21", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "简直是惨不忍睹的景象"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 23, "start": "0:01:21.67", "end": "0:01:22.59", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真凄惨"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 24, "start": "0:01:24.48", "end": "0:01:26.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉  没有办法"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 25, "start": "0:01:28.70", "end": "0:01:30.90", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没人向投手铃木发出嘘声"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 26, "start": "0:01:31.30", "end": "0:01:33.05", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样就是8：0了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 27, "start": "0:01:33.61", "end": "0:01:36.26", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比赛进入了艰巨的时刻"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:16.28", "end": "0:03:17.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太慢了  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:18.14", "end": "0:03:19.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多拿点干劲出来！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:20.05", "end": "0:03:23.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "居然让本团长等你  你以为自己是谁啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:23.41", "end": "0:03:24.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要惩罚啦  惩罚"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:25.72", "end": "0:03:30.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我明明就提前了15分钟来  为什么每次都是最后啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:30.95", "end": "0:03:34.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  全都到齐了  出发吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:34.95", "end": "0:03:37.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉  你就载实玖瑠吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:38.18", "end": "0:03:38.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "诶？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:38.99", "end": "0:03:41.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我和有希坐阿虚后面"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:43.68", "end": "0:03:45.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我姑且问一句  去哪里？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:46.88", "end": "0:03:48.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是去市民游泳池啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:48.98", "end": "0:03:52.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏天当然要有夏天的样子  要做有夏天特色的事情"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 40, "start": "0:03:53.13", "end": "0:03:56.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间可是一去不返的啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 41, "start": "0:03:57.00", "end": "0:04:01.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以现在就要行动  在这个只有一次的高一的暑假里"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:02.47", "end": "0:04:04.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "失去的时间啊…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:14.80", "end": "0:04:18.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  这消毒液的气味  真给人一种实在的感觉啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:19.49", "end": "0:04:20.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:25.20", "end": "0:04:25.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呀…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:25.83", "end": "0:04:27.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来～啊！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:27.82", "end": "0:04:29.52", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（禁止跳水  危险！）"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:29.79", "end": "0:04:33.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "赶紧过来  水温温的很舒服哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:33.57", "end": "0:04:37.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙就看不见到处贴的那些禁止跳水的文字说明么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:38.17", "end": "0:04:39.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过很让人欣慰呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:40.52", "end": "0:04:45.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不觉得  凉宫同学也学会了有常识性的娱乐方法了么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:46.00", "end": "0:04:50.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "突然打个电话过来  单方面地说好就挂的邀请方式"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 53, "start": "0:04:51.30", "end": "0:04:53.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实在不能说得上是常识性的吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 54, "start": "0:04:54.19", "end": "0:05:00.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎呀  笑得那么开心的凉宫同学  是不会做什么震动这个世界的事情的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:00.90", "end": "0:05:02.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真是那样就好了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:04.32", "end": "0:05:09.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用担心  自从上次合宿以来  也没引起过什么让人注目的问题"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:10.18", "end": "0:05:14.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在这会儿  对凉宫同学而言也好  对我们来说也好"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:14.93", "end": "0:05:16.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "世界就是和平的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:22.64", "end": "0:05:24.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "差不多吃饭吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:24.67", "end": "0:05:27.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "居然是  实玖瑠亲手做的三明治哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:28.09", "end": "0:05:29.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:29.98", "end": "0:05:31.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很好吃啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:31.47", "end": "0:05:32.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢称赞"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:33.10", "end": "0:05:34.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我再吃一块炸鸡"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:35.07", "end": "0:05:36.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  给我倒茶"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:36.62", "end": "0:05:37.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好～"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:38.19", "end": "0:05:40.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确实  非常和平啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:41.34", "end": "0:05:42.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好意思"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:42.88", "end": "0:05:44.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好  上了哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:44.47", "end": "0:05:49.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与其说是市民泳池  倒是个更适合平民泳池这名字的地方"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:50.74", "end": "0:05:53.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  实玖瑠你在干什么啦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:57.30", "end": "0:05:59.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种过暑假的方法倒也不赖"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:02.77", "end": "0:06:03.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:04.41", "end": "0:06:09.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这些就是我的团员们  说什么都会听的  所以随便吩咐吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:09.65", "end": "0:06:10.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:15.27", "end": "0:06:18.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我试着考虑了下今后的活动计划  如何呢？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:19.12", "end": "0:06:20.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是啥？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:20.89", "end": "0:06:24.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要怎样来度过已经所剩无几的暑假的计划表"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:24.96", "end": "0:06:26.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "SOS团的？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:26.40", "end": "0:06:30.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  暑假只剩下两周了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:30.39", "end": "0:06:35.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "觉得还有很多事情没做呢  要一起都做完哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:35.86", "end": "0:06:39.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  在暑假不能不做的事情…么…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:40.07", "end": "0:06:45.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夏期合宿  游泳池  盆舞  烟花汇演  打工  天体观测…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:45.82", "end": "0:06:47.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有好多啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:47.95", "end": "0:06:52.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个表上的东西要在两周之内都做完啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:52.67", "end": "0:06:54.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有别的想要做的事情么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:54.97", "end": "0:06:58.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…  我想捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:58.31", "end": "0:07:00.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "OK  捞金鱼"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 89, "start": "0:07:01.25", "end": "0:07:02.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么明天开始实行"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 90, "start": "0:07:03.59", "end": "0:07:06.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这附近有什么地方明天会跳盆舞么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 91, "start": "0:07:06.97", "end": "0:07:08.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有烟花汇演也可以"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:09.01", "end": "0:07:11.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至少查过了再给我实行啊！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:11.85", "end": "0:07:14.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我去查吧  回头联系"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:15.40", "end": "0:07:19.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  别忘了捞金鱼哦  这可是实玖瑠的强烈要求哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:20.12", "end": "0:07:20.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:24.72", "end": "0:07:27.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么总是我付钱啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:27.68", "end": "0:07:29.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为你迟到了  这是当然的吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:29.64", "end": "0:07:31.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天可别让人等了啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:31.82", "end": "0:07:33.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  今天就此解散"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:36.65", "end": "0:07:39.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  现在开始每天都玩么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:45.77", "end": "0:07:50.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天早晨  将我的懒觉夺走的又是春日打来的电话"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:54.67", "end": "0:07:59.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "找到跳盆舞的会场了  时间是今晚  地点是市民运动场"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 103, "start": "0:08:00.11", "end": "0:08:02.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真亏她能时机正好地找到"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 104, "start": "0:08:02.94", "end": "0:08:07.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我心中正半怀佩服时  春日说出了这样的话"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 105, "start": "0:08:07.40", "end": "0:08:09.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家一起去买浴衣！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 106, "start": "0:08:09.50", "end": "0:08:11.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠和有希都说没有"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 107, "start": "0:08:12.29", "end": "0:08:14.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买一整套的话就会便宜  我们走吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 108, "start": "0:08:15.71", "end": "0:08:20.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日擅自为朝比奈学姐和长门挑选了以后  毫不客气地冲进了试衣间"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 109, "start": "0:08:21.60", "end": "0:08:23.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可相当花时间"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 110, "start": "0:08:25.51", "end": "0:08:32.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "期间频遭女性顾客冷眼  我们等了大约一小时  三个人终于都换好出来了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:32.80", "end": "0:08:33.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:35.51", "end": "0:08:36.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:37.15", "end": "0:08:39.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各位  都非常合适哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:39.61", "end": "0:08:42.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然啦  是我给挑选的嘛"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:42.51", "end": "0:08:43.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "特别是实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:44.15", "end": "0:08:46.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真不愧是我挑的  好可爱"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:46.66", "end": "0:08:49.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是不会看走眼的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:51.52", "end": "0:08:56.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "确实  这是在春日强行加上的服装中最顶级的货"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:57.00", "end": "0:08:59.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "话说回来  超合适  这个给YES"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:57.00", "end": "0:08:59.22", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（YESだね：捏自Brain Power(机动神脑)的台词）"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:59.40", "end": "0:09:02.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就是这个国家的古典民俗衣着啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 122, "start": "0:09:03.19", "end": "0:09:06.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然胸口有点难受  不过好漂亮"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 123, "start": "0:09:06.56", "end": "0:09:10.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样就准备好了  那么出发吧  去盆舞会场"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 124, "start": "0:09:18.04", "end": "0:09:22.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过盆舞啊  感觉好像很久没有看到过了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 125, "start": "0:09:22.57", "end": "0:09:26.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  实玖瑠  你想要玩的捞金鱼也有哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 126, "start": "0:09:26.31", "end": "0:09:30.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捞个痛快吧  黑色凸眼金鱼可是加200分的哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:31.21", "end": "0:09:34.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也去玩吧  来比比看能捞多少条如何"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:35.11", "end": "0:09:38.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我PASS  比起那个我还是对食物有兴趣"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:39.13", "end": "0:09:41.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门你觉得如何  要吃点什么吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:45.81", "end": "0:09:47.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对那种东西有兴趣么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:54.48", "end": "0:09:54.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:56.02", "end": "0:09:57.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好的  800日元"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 133, "start": "0:10:01.69", "end": "0:10:06.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "13条  虽然是大丰收但我不需要那么多  就只要了一条"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 134, "start": "0:10:07.13", "end": "0:10:12.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我倒是完全捞不起来  捞金鱼好难啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 135, "start": "0:10:12.97", "end": "0:10:15.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不不  正常人是捞不了那么多的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 136, "start": "0:10:16.23", "end": "0:10:18.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要有诀窍的话就很简单了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 137, "start": "0:10:19.04", "end": "0:10:21.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦  有希  那个面具是怎么搞的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 138, "start": "0:10:21.97", "end": "0:10:22.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "买的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 139, "start": "0:10:23.02", "end": "0:10:25.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样吗…不过为什么要这个？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 140, "start": "0:10:26.83", "end": "0:10:29.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概是波长相合吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 141, "start": "0:10:29.51", "end": "0:10:30.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只因为是宇宙人"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 142, "start": "0:10:31.81", "end": "0:10:32.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  不管了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 143, "start": "0:10:33.08", "end": "0:10:35.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那一块还没转过  一起去吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 144, "start": "0:10:36.26", "end": "0:10:37.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还要玩么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 145, "start": "0:10:37.49", "end": "0:10:39.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然啦  走吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 146, "start": "0:11:06.63", "end": "0:11:07.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 147, "start": "0:11:07.87", "end": "0:11:09.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只吃一个的话没关系哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 148, "start": "0:11:10.76", "end": "0:11:12.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  谢谢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 149, "start": "0:11:14.34", "end": "0:11:15.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好吃么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 150, "start": "0:11:15.39", "end": "0:11:15.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 151, "start": "0:11:16.12", "end": "0:11:16.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很好"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 152, "start": "0:11:17.21", "end": "0:11:19.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  盆舞也差不多跳完了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 153, "start": "0:11:20.16", "end": "0:11:21.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来玩烟花吧  烟花"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 154, "start": "0:11:22.37", "end": "0:11:23.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "烟花…么…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 155, "start": "0:11:24.29", "end": "0:11:28.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难得穿这身  今天就一起做了吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 156, "start": "0:11:28.97", "end": "0:11:33.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也对  对面的店里就有卖的  就去河边吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 157, "start": "0:11:33.74", "end": "0:11:34.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像很开心嘛"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 158, "start": "0:11:35.11", "end": "0:11:36.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么走吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 159, "start": "0:11:49.06", "end": "0:11:50.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "柿崎！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 160, "start": "0:11:49.06", "end": "0:11:50.27", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（此处捏自「超时空要塞Macross」剧场版的柿崎机(VF-1A)）"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 161, "start": "0:12:04.63", "end": "0:12:06.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  好漂亮"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 162, "start": "0:12:07.46", "end": "0:12:09.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "盆舞  烟花"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 163, "start": "0:12:10.14", "end": "0:12:11.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样就好了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 164, "start": "0:12:11.47", "end": "0:12:13.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么明天是捉昆虫哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 165, "start": "0:12:13.92", "end": "0:12:18.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日啊  虽说玩也没问题  你暑假作业做完了么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 166, "start": "0:12:18.33", "end": "0:12:20.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说一点也没有动的我说这话有点那啥就是了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 167, "start": "0:12:20.86", "end": "0:12:25.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么了  那种程度的作业有三天不就全部做完了吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 168, "start": "0:12:25.40", "end": "0:12:25.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "三天？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 169, "start": "0:12:26.27", "end": "0:12:28.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我七月就解决掉了哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 170, "start": "0:12:28.73", "end": "0:12:33.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种麻烦事就得事先赶紧收拾了  再毫无后顾之忧地玩到爽"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 171, "start": "0:12:33.92", "end": "0:12:36.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是正确的享受暑假的方法"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 172, "start": "0:12:36.92", "end": "0:12:42.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么这种家伙脑子这么好  上天对于人的参数调整还真是随便啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 173, "start": "0:12:43.05", "end": "0:12:45.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总而言之  明天去捉昆虫"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 174, "start": "0:12:45.53", "end": "0:12:49.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "捉到的虫子最多的那个人…  这样吧…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 175, "start": "0:12:49.44", "end": "0:12:51.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就把团长的权力让给他一天！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 176, "start": "0:12:52.10", "end": "0:12:52.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇  不需要"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 177, "start": "0:12:53.37", "end": "0:12:56.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很有趣呢  只要是虫子的话什么都可以么"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 178, "start": "0:12:56.66", "end": "0:12:59.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…只能抓蝉"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 179, "start": "0:12:59.84", "end": "0:13:03.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没错  这就是SOS团内部的捉蝉大战"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 180, "start": "0:13:03.43", "end": "0:13:05.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪怕只多抓了一只也算赢！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 181, "start": "0:13:10.03", "end": "0:13:10.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 182, "start": "0:13:11.27", "end": "0:13:15.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为了祈雨  我把晴天娃娃用五寸钉刺着"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 183, "start": "0:13:15.71", "end": "0:13:18.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到来的却是万里无云的好天气"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 184, "start": "0:13:18.39", "end": "0:13:23.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "蝉也为今年夏天最热的一天而雀跃不已"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 185, "start": "0:13:24.26", "end": "0:13:27.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来  蝉能够拿来吃吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 186, "start": "0:13:27.24", "end": "0:13:27.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 187, "start": "0:13:28.19", "end": "0:13:29.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许弄成天妇罗会是极品"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 188, "start": "0:13:30.11", "end": "0:13:31.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你一个人吃吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 189, "start": "0:13:32.21", "end": "0:13:34.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  我有时会想"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 190, "start": "0:13:34.55", "end": "0:13:37.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "天妇罗会不会只是外面一层面衣好吃呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 191, "start": "0:13:38.01", "end": "0:13:40.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那样的话  那蝉也可以啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 192, "start": "0:13:40.30", "end": "0:13:42.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快道歉！快向全国的天妇罗店道歉！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 193, "start": "0:13:44.52", "end": "0:13:45.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 194, "start": "0:13:45.99", "end": "0:13:51.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你让青春年华的高中生拿着虫网与笼子聚集在一起"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 195, "start": "0:13:51.80", "end": "0:13:52.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底有什么企图"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 196, "start": "0:13:52.80", "end": "0:13:57.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在说什么啊  没有虫网的话怎么抓蝉啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 197, "start": "0:13:57.65", "end": "0:13:59.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不是问那个…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 198, "start": "0:13:59.87", "end": "0:14:03.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那我们开始了  优胜者可以当一天的团长！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 199, "start": "0:14:03.78", "end": "0:14:05.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  开始！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 200, "start": "0:14:05.81", "end": "0:14:06.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "完全没在听…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 201, "start": "0:14:06.75", "end": "0:14:08.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那…那个…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 202, "start": "0:14:08.97", "end": "0:14:10.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她真的想赢啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 203, "start": "0:14:10.91", "end": "0:14:12.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不是很好吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 204, "start": "0:14:13.18", "end": "0:14:16.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  捕蝉的话  小学不都试过了吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 205, "start": "0:14:18.06", "end": "0:14:20.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也是啊  尽力而行吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 206, "start": "0:14:27.15", "end": "0:14:28.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  已经抓到了吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 207, "start": "0:14:30.99", "end": "0:14:32.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那不是蝉啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 208, "start": "0:14:33.57", "end": "0:14:34.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 209, "start": "0:14:36.77", "end": "0:14:37.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "海…海格力斯！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 210, "start": "0:14:36.77", "end": "0:14:37.97", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（大力神独角仙(D.hercules)，胸部有大而光滑的角）"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 211, "start": "0:15:14.23", "end": "0:15:15.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "公布结果！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 212, "start": "0:15:16.03", "end": "0:15:17.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠一只"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 213, "start": "0:15:17.54", "end": "0:15:18.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希四只"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 214, "start": "0:15:19.03", "end": "0:15:20.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉七只"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 215, "start": "0:15:20.61", "end": "0:15:21.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚九只"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 216, "start": "0:15:22.11", "end": "0:15:23.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后最高纪录是…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 217, "start": "0:15:23.86", "end": "0:15:25.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃  你不用说都知道是谁了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 218, "start": "0:15:25.65", "end": "0:15:27.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我！十二只！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 219, "start": "0:15:27.79", "end": "0:15:31.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然  团长之座一天都让不出去"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 220, "start": "0:15:31.33", "end": "0:15:32.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家真是可惜了啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 221, "start": "0:15:33.04", "end": "0:15:36.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不会真的想把它们做成天妇罗吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 222, "start": "0:15:36.71", "end": "0:15:38.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么  你想吃吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 223, "start": "0:15:38.78", "end": "0:15:39.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么成我要吃了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 224, "start": "0:15:40.10", "end": "0:15:41.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开个玩笑而已"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 225, "start": "0:15:41.55", "end": "0:15:44.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说到底  还是要有放生的精神"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 226, "start": "0:15:44.70", "end": "0:15:47.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天放它们一条生路  以后说不定会来报恩呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 227, "start": "0:15:48.96", "end": "0:15:50.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  快回山里去吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 228, "start": "0:15:51.20", "end": "0:15:52.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要再被抓了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 229, "start": "0:15:59.86", "end": "0:16:00.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呃  慢着"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 230, "start": "0:16:00.93", "end": "0:16:04.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说是说得好听  但你这只是单方面的捕捉后放生吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 231, "start": "0:16:06.84", "end": "0:16:08.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后是接着的下一天"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 232, "start": "0:16:09.37", "end": "0:16:11.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日不知从何处找来了兼职"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 233, "start": "0:16:11.74", "end": "0:16:14.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还难得为我们争取了机会"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 234, "start": "0:16:15.08", "end": "0:16:16.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本地超市的纪念促销宣传活动"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 235, "start": "0:16:17.32", "end": "0:16:18.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  你们加油吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 236, "start": "0:16:19.06", "end": "0:16:20.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工作内容是吸引顾客"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 237, "start": "0:16:24.09", "end": "0:16:27.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "非常感谢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 238, "start": "0:16:27.30", "end": "0:16:28.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请看一下"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 239, "start": "0:16:31.20", "end": "0:16:31.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 240, "start": "0:16:35.56", "end": "0:16:39.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么…连我都非得装成这个样子"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 241, "start": "0:16:40.12", "end": "0:16:41.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算是暑假的兼职"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 242, "start": "0:16:41.86", "end": "0:16:43.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也有别的做法吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 243, "start": "0:16:44.70", "end": "0:16:47.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且春日只是在一旁凉快"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 244, "start": "0:16:47.95", "end": "0:16:50.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样下来与她的日薪要是一样的话  绝对要暴动的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 245, "start": "0:16:53.69", "end": "0:16:56.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我终于能明白脱皮后蛇的心情了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 246, "start": "0:16:56.43", "end": "0:16:58.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈哈  真是一个好例子"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 247, "start": "0:16:59.09", "end": "0:17:00.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "辛苦了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 248, "start": "0:17:00.44", "end": "0:17:02.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "店长大叔也谢谢大家了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 249, "start": "0:17:03.27", "end": "0:17:04.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要大叔的感谢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 250, "start": "0:17:05.11", "end": "0:17:05.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "工钱呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 251, "start": "0:17:06.97", "end": "0:17:07.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个咯"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 252, "start": "0:17:07.99", "end": "0:17:08.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 253, "start": "0:17:09.01", "end": "0:17:10.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个外套就是工钱了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 254, "start": "0:17:11.23", "end": "0:17:13.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我很早之前就很想要的了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 255, "start": "0:17:14.30", "end": "0:17:18.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大叔也看在实玖瑠的份上说送给我们的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 256, "start": "0:17:18.40", "end": "0:17:20.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这只青蛙要放在社团室里当作纪念"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 257, "start": "0:17:21.21", "end": "0:17:24.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你想什么时候穿都可以哦"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 258, "start": "0:17:24.58", "end": "0:17:25.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我许可的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 259, "start": "0:17:27.45", "end": "0:17:28.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呱呱"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 260, "start": "0:17:31.65", "end": "0:17:34.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "泳池  盂兰盆节  捕虫  兼职"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 261, "start": "0:17:34.94", "end": "0:17:37.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后春日进行的就是天体观测"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 262, "start": "0:17:38.92", "end": "0:17:42.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  这就是这个年代的望远镜吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 263, "start": "0:17:42.91", "end": "0:17:45.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "与开普勒时代的没什么不同呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 264, "start": "0:17:45.77", "end": "0:17:47.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  我觉得相差很远…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 265, "start": "0:17:48.09", "end": "0:17:49.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是买来的吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 266, "start": "0:17:50.26", "end": "0:17:53.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是  我小时候的兴趣就是这个"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 267, "start": "0:17:54.43", "end": "0:17:58.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第一次看见木星卫星的时候真的十分激动"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 268, "start": "0:17:59.01", "end": "0:17:59.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 269, "start": "0:18:00.36", "end": "0:18:01.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以看到了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 270, "start": "0:18:01.56", "end": "0:18:02.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是火星"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 271, "start": "0:18:05.55", "end": "0:18:06.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会不会存在呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 272, "start": "0:18:07.00", "end": "0:18:07.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 273, "start": "0:18:08.27", "end": "0:18:09.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "火星人"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 274, "start": "0:18:09.68", "end": "0:18:11.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我倒不希望它存在啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 275, "start": "0:18:11.49", "end": "0:18:15.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "章鱼一样的怪物蜿蜒地计划着征服地球的图像"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 276, "start": "0:18:15.86", "end": "0:18:17.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算要说好话我也不觉得有趣"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 277, "start": "0:18:18.14", "end": "0:18:18.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 278, "start": "0:18:19.18", "end": "0:18:21.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说不定是十分友好的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 279, "start": "0:18:22.20", "end": "0:18:26.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "肯定是在地下的大空洞偷偷地生活着的害羞人种"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 280, "start": "0:18:27.21", "end": "0:18:30.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为了不让地球人感到吃惊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 281, "start": "0:18:30.92", "end": "0:18:34.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你脑内的火星人到底有多么文雅啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 282, "start": "0:18:35.31", "end": "0:18:36.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "火星就算了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 283, "start": "0:18:37.00", "end": "0:18:38.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们来找UFO吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 284, "start": "0:18:39.04", "end": "0:18:43.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在卫星轨道上  一定有异星人的先遣队在待机"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 285, "start": "0:18:43.53", "end": "0:18:45.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来  实玖瑠也来帮忙"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 286, "start": "0:18:46.12", "end": "0:18:52.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…呃…UFO  UFO…"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 287, "start": "0:18:58.30", "end": "0:19:00.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "暑假还未结束"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 288, "start": "0:19:00.28", "end": "0:19:01.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日接着要做的是——"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 289, "start": "0:19:02.56", "end": "0:19:04.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到击球中心"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 290, "start": "0:19:04.57", "end": "0:19:05.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么要到那里"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 291, "start": "0:19:05.67", "end": "0:19:08.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一大早看见甲子园的新闻我就想到了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 292, "start": "0:19:08.50", "end": "0:19:11.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们不能只满足于那些杂牌的棒球比赛"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 293, "start": "0:19:12.03", "end": "0:19:16.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们SOS团要建成以全国为目标的队伍"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 294, "start": "0:19:21.13", "end": "0:19:22.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "打中吧！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 295, "start": "0:19:26.98", "end": "0:19:28.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是了不起啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 296, "start": "0:19:28.86", "end": "0:19:30.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那能量到底是从哪里来的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 297, "start": "0:19:31.21", "end": "0:19:36.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说不定是细胞内的线粒体与常人不一样吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 298, "start": "0:19:36.74", "end": "0:19:39.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这些能量能为世人用上一点就好了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 299, "start": "0:19:39.99", "end": "0:19:41.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 300, "start": "0:19:47.19", "end": "0:19:52.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后  谁也不能阻止春日定下的定额消耗态势"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 301, "start": "0:19:52.73", "end": "0:19:55.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们不停地跟着行动"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 302, "start": "0:19:57.58", "end": "0:19:59.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也去了真正的烟花大会"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 303, "start": "0:20:00.65", "end": "0:20:06.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们也将砰砰地射上高空\n又碰碰地绽放的烟花观赏到满足为止"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 304, "start": "0:20:08.37", "end": "0:20:13.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在另一天  我们则在县边境的河边参加钓虾虎鱼大会"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 305, "start": "0:20:19.51", "end": "0:20:20.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊！"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 306, "start": "0:20:21.56", "end": "0:20:23.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  实玖瑠  竿子竿子"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 307, "start": "0:20:23.63", "end": "0:20:25.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "交给我吧  我会拿回来的"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 308, "start": "0:20:27.19", "end": "0:20:28.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下还有"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 309, "start": "0:20:28.44", "end": "0:20:30.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说是固定节目"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 310, "start": "0:20:30.40", "end": "0:20:33.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但应该没有人真会去玩的试胆大会"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 311, "start": "0:20:36.70", "end": "0:20:38.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去看了只有宣传非常像那么回事"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 312, "start": "0:20:39.14", "end": "0:20:41.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但内容大家都心知肚明的大制作电影的联播"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 313, "start": "0:20:46.16", "end": "0:20:50.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在完全是淡季的会漂来水母的海滩上进行海水浴"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 314, "start": "0:20:51.62", "end": "0:20:56.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "直到所有人都达到全清才能离开的保龄球惩罚游戏"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 315, "start": "0:20:58.71", "end": "0:21:03.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "挑战喉咙极限的长时间耐久卡拉OK"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 316, "start": "0:21:08.74", "end": "0:21:12.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我甚至觉得包括了很多与夏天无关的活动"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 317, "start": "0:21:12.52", "end": "0:21:17.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  我们在这两周内玩到再起不能"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 318, "start": "0:21:22.91", "end": "0:21:25.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "今天是8月30日"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 319, "start": "0:21:25.34", "end": "0:21:26.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "课题都完成了呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 320, "start": "0:21:27.45", "end": "0:21:29.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唉呀唉呀  总算顺利完成了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 321, "start": "0:21:29.83", "end": "0:21:32.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯…这样就行了吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 322, "start": "0:21:33.73", "end": "0:21:36.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是…嗯  也就这样吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 323, "start": "0:21:37.16", "end": "0:21:39.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们还有什么想做的吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 324, "start": "0:21:39.62", "end": "0:21:40.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我没有什么了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 325, "start": "0:21:40.82", "end": "0:21:41.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经够了吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 326, "start": "0:21:42.34", "end": "0:21:44.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想好好睡一觉"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 327, "start": "0:21:44.84", "end": "0:21:45.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希呢"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:47.32", "end": "0:21:47.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:48.83", "end": "0:21:52.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也好  这个夏天都干了不少事情"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:53.04", "end": "0:21:55.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "四处游玩  也穿上了浴衣"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:55.45", "end": "0:21:56.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "蝉也抓了不少"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:58.52", "end": "0:22:00.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就到这里为止吧  嗯"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 333, "start": "0:22:01.28", "end": "0:22:04.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…这家伙还有什么遗憾吗"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 334, "start": "0:22:05.05", "end": "0:22:06.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此为止了"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 335, "start": "0:22:07.25", "end": "0:22:08.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明天就空下来当是预备日"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 336, "start": "0:22:09.04", "end": "0:22:10.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们好好地休息吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 337, "start": "0:22:13.01", "end": "0:22:15.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "后天再在社团教室见面吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 338, "start": "0:22:30.50", "end": "0:22:33.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…啊  作业完全没有做"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 339, "start": "0:22:42.31", "end": "0:22:44.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "8月31日  暑假的最后一天"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 340, "start": "0:22:46.18", "end": "0:22:49.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反正怎么努力都不可能把作业做完"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 341, "start": "0:22:49.69", "end": "0:22:51.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也没法消除玩后的疲劳"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 342, "start": "0:22:51.94", "end": "0:22:56.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我就这样子拖拖拉拉地过了懒散的一天"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 343, "start": "0:23:00.67", "end": "0:23:01.47", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "搞啥啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 344, "start": "0:23:01.79", "end": "0:23:02.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真无聊啊"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 345, "start": "0:23:07.29", "end": "0:23:09.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不管了  由它去吧"}
{"ep": "12", "idx": 346, "start": "0:23:27.93", "end": "0:23:31.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "睡吧  明天还要上学"}
